  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Description/Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/APDailyKPIv2/DescriptionMetricDefinitions?rev=' id='DescriptionMetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/WIPAPDailyKPI-OnePage' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1300' maxwidth='1000' minheight='1300' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98770' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='615'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Introduction</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>APAC Daily KPI dashboard contains key metrics that are used by the Senior Leadership to track the overall performance of the company.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>This dashboard is being sent out to a group of management leaders every 9AM at </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>pandata-daily-report </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>slack channel.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total Orders </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total number of successful orders and total pandago orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total GMV EUR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total GMV of valid orders in EUR. GMV is defined as GFV plus delivery fees, service fees, container charges, difference to MOV and also includes priority delivery fee and add-pro-to-cart values, after basket updates, in local currency</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total Revenue EUR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total Commission Revenue EUR + Total Delivery Fee EUR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Revenue/GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total Revenue EUR  / Total GMV</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>AFV EUR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total Gross Food Value EUR  / Total number of successful orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total New Vendors</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total new vendors that are onboarded to the foodpanda platform</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total Churned Vendors</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total vendors that are marked as &quot;Terminated&quot; on salesforce where reasons are not &quot;Onboarding Failed&quot; and &quot;Duplicate&quot;. Excludes test vendors.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total Sessions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total unique sessions on the foodpanda platform</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total CVR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Total unique sessions with transactions / Total unique sessions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16' underline='true'>MTD MoM with Different Days</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Standard Formula</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>MTD MoM = (MTD of current month - MTD of previous month) / MTD of previous month</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Adjustment for Different Number of Days</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>When the number of days in the current month and the previous month are different (e.g., calculating on 3/30 wehn February has only 28 days), the previous month&apos;s MTD is adjusted to a comparable scale:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>MTD of previous month = (Total value of the previous month / total days of the month) * days of the current month</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Example</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>To calculate MTD Orders MoM on 2025/03/30:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>* February 2025 has 28 days</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>* Total Orders in February / 28 * 30 = Adjusted MTD of February</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>* Use this adjusted value as the denominator in the MoM formula</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
